  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Quality and Safety of Southern Highlands Avocados for Global Markets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture avocado production and marketing value chain. Beneficiaries: More than 3,000 beneficiaries of which more than 1,500 are women will be directly and indirectly impacted through increased level of productive employment, increased incomes and improved level of livelihoods in rural Tanzania. Description: The grant will enhance the capacity of Agripromise to supply better quality avocado seedlings, improve avocado production and productivity through a robust extension service that trains the farmers and supplies them with much needed inputs on time. The grant will as well improve the financial and entrepreneurial capacity of Agripromise business owners who are largely agricultural scientists. Part of the grant will support the certification protocols at Agripromise to ensure the avocados meet food safety requirements of both the local and export markets.</narrative>
  </description>
